# GitHub Actions log bundles pulled down while inspecting a run
# (`gh api .../actions/runs/<id>/logs > z.zip`). These are per-job debug output, not source:
# committing them buries real changes under tens of thousands of log lines. The patterns are
# deliberately narrow — a broad `*_*.txt` would also hide real files.
*.zip
apklogs/
/Connected backend (live project)/
/Offline validation (no credentials)/
/Apply migrations to the live project/
/Rork Auth (optional credentials)/

